    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classEvent" kindref="compound">Event</ref> dispatched when an enemy dies. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Contains the enemy&apos;s position at death and the score value awarded.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This event can be used by UI systems to update score or by audio systems to play death sounds. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classEnemySystem" kindref="compound">EnemySystem</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
